  The reel_script says the family 'said' the SI spoke rudely as the reason, but it omits the family's demand that legal action be taken against the SI before the body would be moved, which is an important part of the article's account.
  The reel_script and caption say the relatives went to the police station to get a letter for post-mortem, but the article says they went to get a letter for the post-mortem (பிரேத பரிசோதனை செய்வதற்காக) so the caption wording 'பிரேத பரிசோதனை கடிதம் வாங்க' is acceptable, yet the reel_script omits that the body was to be buried after post-mortem, which is not a real error.
