  The slides say 'பிரேத பரிசோதனை கடிதம் வாங்க சென்றபோது' as the cause, but the article says the letter was needed to conduct the post-mortem, which the slide's phrasing ('for post-mortem letter') accurately reflects; however the reel_script omits that the body was brought after post-mortem to be buried, a minor omission.
